# Clean main before commit

Before making commits, confirm you are on `main` and understand the delta you
are about to add to trunk.

## Before the first commit on new work

1. `git fetch origin main`
2. `git status --short`
3. `git log --oneline origin/main..HEAD`

## Before pushing

```bash
git fetch origin main
git log --oneline origin/main..HEAD
```

Every commit listed should belong to this task. If you see unrelated commits, fix history before push.
